#800 #0
owner=#0
name=Help
description=General command help topics (full reference in help.md).
say=say <text>   (alias: ")
    Speak aloud to everyone in your room.
emote=emote <action>   (aliases: : and ::)
    Describe an action to the room in the third person.
    :: glues the text onto your name for possessives.
whisper=whisper <player> <text>
    A private line to one player in the room with you.
page=page <player> <text>
    A private line to a connected player anywhere on the server.
look=look
    Show your room: its description, exits, and who is here.
help=help [topic]
    'help' lists topics; 'help <topic>' prints one. See help.md for detail.
quit=quit
    Disconnect. Your character and its state persist.
building=@create #<parent>  @set #N.prop=value  @examine #N
    @edit #N.prop  @view #N.prop  @chmod #N.prop=rw,r,r  @chown #N=#M  @chgrp #N=#G
    Create and edit objects (wizard or owner gated). See the editor topic.
store=buy <item> [from <store>]  |  list [from <store>]
    Buy priced items from a vendor or a vending machine in the room.
groups=@group create|add|remove|list
    Permission groups: share write access to an object across accounts.
invite=@invite  |  @invite new
    List your invite codes, or (admin) make another. New accounts join by code.
feedback=@gripe|@typo|@bug|@idea|@suggest|@comment <text>
    Send a tagged note to the operators, logged with your name and room.
editor=@edit #N.prop  |  @view #N.prop
    The web property editor, live markdown highlighting, Ctrl+S to save.
wiki=A wiki object (#0.wiki) holds pages as its properties.
    Set it up with @set #0.wiki=#<id>; edit pages in the web editor.
commands=The ChromeSix game commands, by area (type 'help <area>'):
    character  combat  maneuvers  gear  jobs  social
    General server commands are under 'help' with no topic.
character=chargen <steps>  |  sheet  |  status (st)  |  check <skill>
    train <skill>  |  learn <unlock>
    Make and grow a character. chargen builds one; sheet is the full record and
    status the one-line vitals. check rolls a skill; train and learn spend CP.
combat=attack <foe> [push N]  |  cover | takecover <foe>  |  reload <weapon>
    close | retreat | engage <foe> | disengage  |  guard | ready <weapon>
    ambush <foe>  |  flee <exit>  |  hold
    The fight. attack opens or continues one and push spends Grit for dice. Move
    between range bands, take cover, hold a reaction with guard or ready.
maneuvers=use <unlock> [target]  |  trip <foe>  |  stand  |  staunch
    stun <foe>  |  menace <foe>  |  rend <foe>
    Tactical actions. use activates a learned unlock; the rest impose or clear a
    condition (Prone, Stunned, Shaken, Bleeding) on your turn.
gear=wield <item>  |  wear <item>  |  remove <item>  |  inventory (inv, i)
    get <item> [from <container>]  |  drop <item>  |  put <item> in <container>
    Carry and equip. wield readies a weapon, wear dons armor; the rest move items.
jobs=jobs  |  accept <giver>  |  turnin  |  abandon  |  report  |  treat
    Work for pay and standing. jobs lists offers here; accept takes one and turnin
    completes it. treat mends a wound at a clinic.
social=command <foe>  |  negotiate <foe>  |  con <foe>  |  perform <foe>
    The four Charm approaches in a social scene, each pressing a target's Resolve.
start=New here? Type 'chargen' to build a character (attributes, a hook, skills).
    Then 'look' to see the room, 'status' for your vitals, and 'help commands'
    for what you can do. Find work with 'jobs', and fight with 'attack <foe>'.

